Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,are you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,f***ing kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,did the 49ers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,just move into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:04.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,the cowboys' house?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,sunday in arlington, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,cowboys hosted the niners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,niners fans took
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,over the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:11.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,and louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,they even booed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,the cowboys for running
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,onto their own field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:16.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,guests got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,584 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,the most the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,cowboys have ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,given up at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:23.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,deebo samuel ran
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,a reverse that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,fooled the whole defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,70 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,front door wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,christian mccaffrey caught
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,touchdowns of 74 and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,66, the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,running back in nfl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,history to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,that in one game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:36.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,meanwhile, dak prescott
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,cleaned up all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,5 touchdown passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,tied his career high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,the cowboys came back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,from 19 down to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:44.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,6, then the last
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,onside kick went nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,final: 46-40.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,the guest review
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,is already up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:50.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,5 stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:51.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,5th straight win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,in dallas' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:54.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,er, over dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,would visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:56.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,the cowboys are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,4 and 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the niners?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:58.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,they took the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,house, ate the fridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:00.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,and left the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:01.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,cowboys with the bill.
